      "refersTo": "lamp-live",
      "description": "Idle, done, and live lamps in pill buttons on the board; live is the only yellow.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-lamps\"><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-done\"></span>Design</button><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-live\"></span>Down payment</button><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp\"></span>Production</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-lamps{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--board,oklch(0.255 0.012 50))}.ds-period{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.006 70));font:500 0.9375rem Archivo,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1),background-color 160ms}.ds-period:hover{background:oklch(0.355 0.02 50/0.7)}.ds-period:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,oklch(0.565 0.19 37.5));outline-offset:3px}.ds-period:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(0.975)}.ds-lamp{width:.7rem;height:.7rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--board-edge,oklch(0.17 0.008 50));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px oklch(0 0 0/0.45);transition:background-color 220ms,box-shadow 220ms}.ds-done{background:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.006 70));box-shadow:0 0 0 1px oklch(1 0 0/0.2)}.ds-live{background:var(--signal,oklch(0.87 0.17 95));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px oklch(0.82 0.165 78/0.25),0 2px 6px oklch(0.82 0.165 78/0.45)}"
