      "refersTo": "size-rail",
      "description": "Identical cells on a strip of board: lit in stock, yellow low, blank well when sold out.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-rail\"><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>S</small>12</li><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>M</small>8</li><li class=\"ds-cell ds-low\"><small>L</small>2</li><li class=\"ds-cell ds-out\"><small>XL</small>–</li><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>2XL</small>5</li></ul>",
